/**
 * Encodes a path-segment array as a JSON Pointer (RFC 6901): empty path
 * becomes `""`, otherwise each segment is escaped (`~` → `~0`, `/` → `~1`)
 * and segments are joined with leading and inter-segment `/`. Inverse of
